7-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-textalign:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand, sans-serif;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-lineheight:23.4px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-letterspacing:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-b1595417-72bf-46d7-96cc-bc84ca02be5f-attributes-texttransform:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p><strong>What happens?</strong></p><br><p>Hormone levels, including estrogen and progesterone, drop significantly, triggering the shedding of the uterine lining. This drop signals the release of prostaglandins, which cause the uterus to contract and shed its lining, resulting in cramps and inflammation. Women often feel bloating, intense cramps, low energy, and heightened mood sensitivity.*</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="ead8b18d-3c86-49d7-a094-6b0b4babf211" class="r-dlf0zc alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-fontsize:14px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f4e2106-1742-4edd-a195-a474795b8511-attributes-tex